     Wand of secret door detection (and spell of detect unseen,
which is equivalent) can detect traps within line of sight (within
its modest radius of effect).  But water squares on the Plain of
Water block line of sight, so effectively it only works if zapped
while inside the same bubble as the portal.  Entry C343-340 on the
known bugs page is about this.  The code has been changed--for some
future version which might be mythical--to override water and clouds
when doing line of sight checking for secret door/trap detection,
so your wand would have worked--or will work, someday...--while in
different bubbles as long as you're within its radius of effect.


